    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "(3) Let x1 and x2 be nonzero elements in b↓ such that x1∧x2 ≠ 0 and (a∧b)∧xk ≠ 0 for each k. This"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
