    "font" : "TeXGyreTermesX-Regular",
    "font size" : 11.955,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "implies a∧(b∧xk) ≠ 0 for each k. Also, observe that ⋀2k=1(b∧xk) = b∧(x1 ∧x2) = x1 ∧x2 ≠ 0. Since a is a µ-element in L, this implies that"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
